    }
   ],
   "brief": {
    "essentiel": "by Dominic Pollard, Director of Communications, City Road Communications For many years, digital PR and SEO were bedfellows.",
    "points": [
     "But slightly begrudging ones… it was, if you will, an unhappy marriage.",
     "The formula was simple enough: brands would engage PR agencies to generate media coverage in the hope of earning backlinks to their website.",
     "This would tell Google their site was a credible source and, in turn, boost their search rankings.",
     "But the fight for search visibility has not become any less intense; it has just taken on a different form, and artificial intelligence (AI) has completely transformed things."
